
# Prompt CS10 — Autonomous Pesticide Spraying Drone (Author-Constructed)

## Prerequisites

Prompts 0–CS9 must be fully implemented. This case study **must be
consistent with Examples 1–4 in the paper** (doc/). Read these examples
extremely carefully before starting. The models must reproduce the paper's
analytical results exactly — this is the validation case study.

