## STEP 2 — Ontology

### File: `assets/CS10_Drone/domain.ont`

**MUST EXACTLY MATCH Example 1 of the paper.** Plus EPPO/EU extensions:

```
; Ontology: Autonomous Pesticide Spraying Drone
; Standards: EPPO PP 1/213(3):2012, EU Regulation 2009/128/EC,
;            EASA Reg.(EU) 2019/947, ISO 16119-4:2014, ICAO Annex 2:2005
; Fragment: QF_LRA
;
; IMPORTANT: Sorts, functions, relations, and base axioms in this file
; MUST be consistent with Definition 5 / Example 1 of the paper.

; === SORTS === (exactly as in Example 1)
sort Hectare      ; unit of land area — discrete field zones
sort Real         ; real-valued energy consumption
sort Nat          ; natural-valued indices

; === FUNCTIONS === (exactly as in Example 1)
fun consumption      : Hectare -> Real  ; energy to cover hectare h
fun num_hectares     : Nat              ; total hectares in mission
fun total_consumption: Real             ; cumulative energy used
fun battery_capacity : Real             ; total battery energy available

; === RELATIONS === (exactly as in Example 1)
rel covered          : Hectare          ; holds when hectare h has been sprayed

; === AXIOMS === (exactly as in Example 1)
axiom num_h         : num_hectares = 10
axiom bat_cap       : battery_capacity = 500
axiom nn_consumption: consumption(1) >= 0
; For all other hectares — Z3 will treat consumption as uninterpreted
; over Hectare sort; axioms below bound the range:
axiom cons_upper    : consumption(1) <= 50
axiom cons_upper_2  : consumption(2) <= 50
axiom cons_upper_3  : consumption(3) <= 50
axiom cons_upper_4  : consumption(4) <= 50
axiom cons_upper_5  : consumption(5) <= 50
; (EPPO PP 1/213(3): max 50 units per hectare)
axiom total_nn      : total_consumption >= 0
axiom total_upper   : total_consumption <= battery_capacity

; === EXTENDED AXIOMS (EPPO / EU 2009/128/EC) ===
; Per-hectare application rate limit (EPPO PP 1/213(3) Section 4.2)
fun max_per_hectare_dose : Real
axiom max_dose_val  : max_per_hectare_dose = 50

; EU 2009/128/EC Article 12 buffer zone (modelled as minimum flight boundary)
fun buffer_zone_width : Real
axiom buffer_val    : buffer_zone_width = 5

; ISO 16119-4 coverage uniformity: minimum spray per hectare
fun min_coverage_per_hectare : Real
axiom min_coverage  : min_coverage_per_hectare = 40

; Battery safety margin (EASA 2019/947 reserve requirement)
fun battery_reserve : Real
axiom bat_reserve   : battery_reserve = 50

; ICAO Annex 2: maximum flight time per sortie (time units)
fun max_flight_time : Real
axiom max_flight    : max_flight_time = 300
```

