## STEP 3 — Interpretations

### File: `assets/CS10_Drone/pt.interp`

**MUST EXACTLY MATCH Example 2 of the paper:**

```
; PT Interpretation: SprayingDronePT
; Exactly as specified in Example 2 of the paper.

; --- Location interpretations ---
GROUNDED       : (= total_consumption 0)
NAVIGATING     : (and (>= total_consumption 0) (<= total_consumption battery_capacity))
ENTERING_ZONE  : (and (>= total_consumption 0) (<= total_consumption battery_capacity - battery_reserve))
SPRAYING       : (and (<= consumption(1) max_per_hectare_dose) (<= total_consumption battery_capacity))
EXITING_ZONE   : (covered 1)
RETURNING      : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)
RECHARGING     : (= total_consumption 0)
FAULT          : (>= total_consumption 0)

; --- Event interpretations (EXACTLY as in Example 2) ---
spray!         : (<= consumption(1) 50)
shutoff!       : (and (<= total_consumption battery_capacity) (covered 1))
exit_zone!     : (covered 1)
enter_zone!    : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity - battery_reserve)
takeoff!       : (= total_consumption 0)
return_base!   : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)
land!          : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)
recharge_complete! : (= total_consumption 0)
fault_detected!: (>= total_consumption 0)
fault_return!  : (>= total_consumption 0)
```

### File: `assets/CS10_Drone/dt.interp`

**MUST EXACTLY MATCH Example 4 of the paper:**

```
; DT Interpretation: EnergyBudgetDT
; Exactly as specified in Example 4 of the paper.

; --- Location interpretations ---
EM_GROUNDED    : (= total_consumption 0)
EM_TRANSIT     : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)
EM_ZONE_ENTRY  : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity - battery_reserve)
EM_APPLYING    : (>= (- (- battery_capacity total_consumption) consumption(1)) (- battery_capacity 50))
EM_ZONE_EXIT   : (covered 1)
EM_RETURNING   : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)
EM_RECHARGING  : (= total_consumption 0)

; --- Event interpretations (EXACTLY as in Example 4) ---
; Z3 MUST confirm: Δ |= I_PT(spray!) ↔ I_DT(apply!)
apply!         : (>= (- (- battery_capacity total_consumption) consumption(1)) (- battery_capacity 50))
; Z3 MUST confirm: Δ |= I_PT(shutoff!) ↔ I_DT(power_down!)
power_down!    : (and (>= (- battery_capacity total_consumption) 0) (covered 1))
coverage_confirmed!   : (covered 1)
zone_entry_logged!    : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity - battery_reserve)
mission_start_logged! : (= total_consumption 0)
base_return_logged!   : (<= total_consumption battery_capacity)
